&lt;p&gt;The Yak Collective is an online space for collaborative tinkering. You can learn more about the what, why, and how on the &lt;a href=&quot;./about&quot; class=&quot;internal alias&quot; data-slug=&quot;about&quot;&gt;about page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this interests you, take a moment to read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://roamresearch.com/#/app/ArtOfGig/page/CF_GEWrWq&quot; class=&quot;external&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;code of conduct&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;external-icon&quot; style=&quot;max-width:0.8em;max-height:0.8em&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 512 512&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M320 0H288V64h32 82.7L201.4 265.4 178.7 288 224 333.3l22.6-22.6L448 109.3V192v32h64V192 32 0H480 320zM32 32H0V64 480v32H32 456h32V480 352 320H424v32 96H64V96h96 32V32H160 32z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt; before joining, and then answer a couple of simple questions (all fields are required) to access our Discord link.&lt;/p&gt;
