&lt;p&gt;— &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/roamhacker/status/1408336566267924480&quot; class=&quot;external&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;RoamHacker — exploring PKM and its future • @roamhacker • 8:09 AM • Jun 25, 2021&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;external-icon&quot; style=&quot;max-width:0.8em;max-height:0.8em&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 512 512&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M320 0H288V64h32 82.7L201.4 265.4 178.7 288 224 333.3l22.6-22.6L448 109.3V192v32h64V192 32 0H480 320zM32 32H0V64 480v32H32 456h32V480 352 320H424v32 96H64V96h96 32V32H160 32z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
