&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.yakcollective.org/projects/astonishing-stories/department-of-restoration&quot; class=&quot;internal&quot; data-slug=&quot;projects/astonishing-stories/department-of-restoration&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;../.././../assets/a20e7a74a940e302eac2678c32c8019c.webp&quot; width=&quot;auto&quot; height=&quot;auto&quot; alt=&quot;Department of Restoration&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At a certain time, in a certain space, a person may speak or act and find himself under a recent form of judgment: cancellation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote class=&quot;callout story is-collapsible is-collapsed&quot; data-callout=&quot;story&quot; data-callout-fold=&quot;&quot;&gt;
