                &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;callout-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.yakcollective.org/projects/astonishing-stories/out-of-the-loop&quot; class=&quot;internal alias&quot; data-slug=&quot;projects/astonishing-stories/out-of-the-loop&quot;&gt;November 20th 2020&lt;/a&gt; • &lt;a href=&quot;https://sachinbenny.notion.site/I-m-Sachin-Benny-7391ec1aafa94af28599a2b089c4bf35&quot; class=&quot;external&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Sachin Benny&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;external-icon&quot; style=&quot;max-width:0.8em;max-height:0.8em&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 512 512&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M320 0H288V64h32 82.7L201.4 265.4 178.7 288 224 333.3l22.6-22.6L448 109.3V192v32h64V192 32 0H480 320zM32 32H0V64 480v32H32 456h32V480 352 320H424v32 96H64V96h96 32V32H160 32z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.yakcollective.org/projects/astonishing-stories/out-of-the-loop&quot; class=&quot;internal&quot; data-slug=&quot;projects/astonishing-stories/out-of-the-loop&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;../.././../assets/a546e6e978ee62702f6741e06675b708.webp&quot; width=&quot;auto&quot; height=&quot;auto&quot; alt=&quot;Out of the Loop&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;He decided then that it was time for him to untangle this mess because no way he was getting laid without a neat graph of thoughts — manufactured or otherwise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote class=&quot;callout story is-collapsible is-collapsed&quot; data-callout=&quot;story&quot; data-callout-fold=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;callout-title&quot;&gt;
                  &lt;div class=&quot;callout-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                  &lt;div class=&quot;callout-title-inner&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.yakcollective.org/projects/astonishing-stories/agglomerizing-the-aesthetic&quot; class=&quot;internal alias&quot; data-slug=&quot;projects/astonishing-stories/agglomerizing-the-aesthetic&quot;&gt;Agglomerizing the Aesthetic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                  &lt;div class=&quot;fold-callout-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;callout-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.yakcollective.org/projects/astonishing-stories/agglomerizing-the-aesthetic&quot; class=&quot;internal alias&quot; data-slug=&quot;projects/astonishing-stories/agglomerizing-the-aesthetic&quot;&gt;November 29th 2020&lt;/a&gt; • &lt;a href=&quot;https://bens.substack.com/&quot; class=&quot;external&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Benjamin Smith&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;external-icon&quot; style=&quot;max-width:0.8em;max-height:0.8em&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 512 512&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M320 0H288V64h32 82.7L201.4 265.4 178.7 288 224 333.3l22.6-22.6L448 109.3V192v32h64V192 32 0H480 320zM32 32H0V64 480v32H32 456h32V480 352 320H424v32 96H64V96h96 32V32H160 32z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.yakcollective.org/projects/astonishing-stories/agglomerizing-the-aesthetic&quot; class=&quot;internal&quot; data-slug=&quot;projects/astonishing-stories/agglomerizing-the-aesthetic&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;../.././../assets/480032c0c8345e954ba4821208cc4afc.webp&quot; width=&quot;auto&quot; height=&quot;auto&quot; alt=&quot;Agglomerizing the Aesthetic&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you needed something, no matter how minor, someone, somewhere in the world could help you with it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;../.././../assets/b2efefdb8a82648cf42f8b8c4875b0ff.webp&quot; width=&quot;auto&quot; height=&quot;auto&quot; alt=&quot;Justice — asterisques.com&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
